<title>CANADA: Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - July 11.</title>
<headline>Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - July 11.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Gas Association (CGA) weekly survey of Canadian natural gas in storage in billion cubic feet (bcf) for the week ended July 11:</p>
<p>							 Pct Full  Pct Full</p>
<p>		 07/04/97  07/04/97  Pct Full  Week Ago  Year Ago</p>
<p>East	     89.77     79.32     38.6	34.1	38.6</p>
<p>West	    132.53    122.50     51.6	47.7	53.3</p>
<p>Total Canada  222.29    201.81     45.4	41.2	46.6</p>
<p>East-West division is the Manitoba/Saskatchewan and North Dakota/Minnesota borders.</p>
<p>East capacity 07/11/97: 232.55 bcf, 07/04/97: 232.55 bcf.</p>
</text>
